  <p>This Privacy Policy describes how INTERDEPENDENT LLC ("INTERDEPENDENT," "we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and discloses information in connection with the website at <a href="https://interdependent.llc">interdependent.llc</a> (the "Site").</p>

